WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.947
After creating a pivot, validate it.

00:00:02.947 --> 00:00:11.652
For additive measures such as revenue, calculate the total from the original source and compare it with the total

00:00:11.652 --> 00:00:17.172
represented by the pivot. If they should represent the same observations, the totals should agree.

00:00:17.172 --> 00:00:23.642
This simple check can catch missing categories, duplicated rows, and incorrect grouping.
